476	- Authorized reopen: ${receipt.frozenAdapter.authorizedReopen.statement}
477	- Derived from committed run evidence: ${receipt.runEvidence.map((item) => `\`${item.path}\` (\`${item.sha256}\`)`).join(', ')}
478	
479	## Both lanes
480	
481	- Baseline (${receipt.lanes.baseline.toolchain}): **${receipt.lanes.baseline.outcome}** — ${receipt.lanes.baseline.statement}
482	- Migrated: **${receipt.lanes.migrated.outcome}** — closure installs, ${receipt.lanes.migrated.buildsAttempted} builds attempted, ${receipt.lanes.migrated.diagnosticsBeforeWall} diagnostics before the last capability pass and ${receipt.lanes.migrated.diagnosticsAtWall} at the wall, no artifact produced. ${receipt.lanes.migrated.statement}
483	
484	## The wall
485	
486	**${receipt.finding.missingCapability}.**
487	
488	${receipt.finding.statement}
489	
490	${receipt.finding.wall.map((entry) => `- \`${entry.library}\` — ${entry.verdict}. Import sites: ${entry.importSites.map((site) => `\`${site}\``).join(', ')}.`).join('\n')}
491	
492	${receipt.finding.libraries} libraries at ${receipt.finding.importSites} import sites. ${receipt.finding.downstreamReading}
493	
494	Action taken: ${receipt.finding.actionTaken}
495	
496	## Declared support boundary
497	
498	**${boundary.condition}**
499	
500	- State: **${boundary.state}** at cell \`${boundary.cell}\` (${boundary.lineage} lineage)
501	- Declared by ${boundary.declaredBy}; published by \`${boundary.publishedBy}\`
502	- Mechanism: ${boundary.mechanism}
503	- Certification: ${boundary.certification}
504	
